<section class="section page-hero">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="badge badge-primary">About Us</span>
      <h1>About Website Downloader</h1>
      <p>{{config.brand.name}} is a free tool for mirroring publicly accessible websites and packaging the collected pages and resources into a single ZIP archive.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Our purpose</h2>
      <p>
        We built {{config.brand.name}} to make it easy to keep an offline copy of public
        web content — pages, stylesheets, images and scripts — for reference,
        study or archival use. The tool is focused, simple, and honest about what
        it can and cannot do.
      </p>
      <h2>What we believe</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Only public content.</strong> We mirror content that is publicly accessible without authentication. Private server-side code, databases and protected resources are never available to download.</li>
        <li><strong>Honest progress.</strong> We show real download progress and real file counts. We never fake percentages or invent results.</li>
        <li><strong>Respect for rights.</strong> Download only content you are authorized to access and store, and respect site terms and copyright.</li>
        <li><strong>Privacy by default.</strong> We do not require accounts and we do not collect personal information beyond standard server logs.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Who maintains it</h2>
      <p>
        {{config.brand.name}} is maintained by {{config.brand.owner}}. Its source is
        open and available under the MIT License. To ask a question or report a
        problem, visit our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
    {{> ad-unit adSlot="1234567890"}}
  </div>
</section>
